# Integer16 addition at the type boundary

Verifies int16 addition at the upper boundary of the 16-bit range through the
complete CLI pipeline. Every operand is int16 to keep this case focused on
same-type boundary semantics.

>>> source
left: int16 = 32760
right: int16 = 7
neg_left: int16 = -32760

// Verifies addition reaching exactly the int16 maximum.
boundary_sum: int16 = left + right
print(boundary_sum)

// Verifies addition of a negative operand staying in range.
negative_sum: int16 = neg_left + right
print(negative_sum)

<<< stdout
32767
-32753

<<< stderr
